// Every user-visible string of Trace: S(EnumId, "key.in.language.packs", "English text").
//
// - Keys are what a language pack file uses, so never rename one casually.
// - {0}, {1}, ... are replaced by numbers or names at run time; {{ and }} are literal braces.
// - English text must not start or end with a space (ini files trim values).
// - Names that are identifiers rather than words (Inter, JetBrains Mono, Trace, SDL, file extensions) are not here.

